  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2021-2026 Nissan Rogue\nOnly fit for carpet flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These nissan rogue all weather floor mats are Compatible for 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 Nissan Rogue; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back.\nBuilt For Durability: YITAMOTOR floor mats for nissan rogue 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 are made from premium TPE material featuring high tensity for great comfort and wear-resistance while remaining flexible and user-friendly even in extreme cold or hot environments; Product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC.\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: Uniquely nissan rogue 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 all season floor liner designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquid, debris, snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips to firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet.\nEasy To Clean: Simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; No vacuuming or harsh chemicals needed for maintenance.\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 nissan rogue rubber car mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle.",
